# ---- China mirror (electron-builder / @electron/get) ----
# electron-builder downloads Electron + winCodeSign/NSIS binaries from GitHub
# releases; on mainland networks that fails with ECONNRESET. npmmirror hosts
# both. `electron_mirror` is honored by @electron/get (npm injects it as
# npm_config_electron_mirror); `electron_builder_binaries_mirror` mirrors
# electron-builder's own binaries. The Electron zip is ALSO covered by
# electronDownload.mirror in electron-builder.yml — belt and suspenders.
electron_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/
electron_builder_binaries_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron-builder-binaries/